&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€60.700&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€75.850 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we care so much about Belonging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re dedicated to helping the whole Planet, and to do that we must strive to represent all of it within each of our offices and on all of our teams. That’s why Planet is guided by an ultimate north star of Belonging—dreaming big as we approach our ongoing work.&amp;nbsp; If this job intrigues you, but you’re thinking you might not have all the qualifications, please... do apply!&amp;nbsp; At Planet, we are looking for well-rounded people from around the world who can contribute to more ways than just what is listed in this job description.&amp;nbsp; We don’t just fill positions, we aspire to fulfill people’s careers, most excited about folks who are motivated by our underlying humanitarian efforts.&amp;nbsp; We are a few orbits around the sun before we get to where we want to be, so we hope you’re excited to come along for the ride.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO statement: &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is committed to building a community where everyone belongs and we invite people from all backgrounds to apply. Planet is an equal opportunity employer, and committed to providing employment opportunities regardless of race, religious creed, color, national origin, ancestry, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, childbirth and breastfeeding, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other protected classification, in accordance with applicable federal, state, and local laws. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is an inclusive community and we know that everyone has their own needs. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation during the hiring process, please reach out to ----- or contact your recruiter with your request. Your message will be confidential and we will be happy to assist you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/#california&quot;&gt;Planet Data Privacy Notice for California Staff Members and Applicants&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy (European Applicants):&lt;/strong&gt; By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice GDPR Planet Labs Europe&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in Our Interviewing Process&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet is committed to providing an exceptional interview experience for all candidates. We currently use &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.metaview.ai/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Metaview&lt;/a&gt; to better focus on candidates and less on trying to capture notes. As such, with the candidate&#39;s consent, select interviews may be recorded and include a &quot;Planet AI Notetaker&quot; for transcription and summarization purposes. Should an interview involve use of AI interview technologies, the candidate will receive notification and have the ability to opt out both in advance and/or real-time. Opting out will not affect one&#39;s candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate AI Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet embraces Artificial Intelligence (AI) tools, and we encourage its responsible use. We understand that candidates may use various resources, including AI tools, to &lt;em&gt;prepare&lt;/em&gt; for interviews and assessments. However, &lt;em&gt;during any live interview stage or when actively completing assessments for this position, the use of AI tools—e.g. Large Language Models (LLMs), deep fake technology, etc.—is strictly prohibited unless explicitly prompted by an interviewer or assessment instructions&lt;/em&gt;. If you are unsure about acceptable use, please contact your recruiter for clarification. If an AI tool or similar technology is desired as an accommodation, please contact ----- with your request for assistance. Your message will be confidential, and we will be happy to assist you. Violation of this policy may result in disqualification of your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Strength in Trust&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;OneTrust’s mission is to enable innovation through the responsible use of data and AI. We believe that ensuring data is trusted shouldn’t slow teams down—it should accelerate what’s possible. This led us to develop the first technology platform for responsible data use in 2016. Today, with AI representing the latest and most impactful expansion of data yet, OneTrust is once again redefining what responsible innovation looks like. OneTrust, the AI‑Ready Governance Platform™, unifies regulatory intelligence, automation, and connected governance workflows so businesses can continue to move at the speed of AI while ensuring good governance to prevent data misuse at scale. Trusted by thousands of organizations worldwide, OneTrust is shaping the future where trusted data becomes a transformative force for business and society.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Challenge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OneTrust, we’re on a mission to help organizations use data and technology responsibly. As a &lt;strong&gt;Strategic Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a pivotal role in driving new business growth while expanding relationships within some of our most important enterprise accounts in &lt;strong&gt;France and Switzerland&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact, consultative sales role focused on engaging senior decision-makers, solving complex business challenges, and delivering meaningful outcomes for customers. You&#39;ll join a fast-growing SaaS company that invests heavily in its sales organization through world-class training, proven methodologies, strong demand generation, executive sponsorship, and customer-led innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you thrive on creating opportunities, navigating complex sales cycles, and winning strategic enterprise deals, this is your opportunity to make a significant impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Strategic Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be responsible for generating, developing, and closing opportunities that help organizations build trust in an increasingly complex business environment while driving revenue growth for OneTrust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as a trusted advisor to senior stakeholders, leveraging your industry expertise, business acumen, and value-based selling skills to uncover customer needs, solve strategic challenges, and position OneTrust as a long-term partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently achieve and exceed revenue targets and performance goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, manage, and advance a healthy pipeline through strategic prospecting and account development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance new business acquisition with expansion opportunities within existing accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles from discovery through contract execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver compelling value-based presentations, demonstrations, and business cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive-level relationships and establish credibility with C-suite decision makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Business Development, Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, and Partner teams to execute account strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand customer priorities and translate them into tailored solutions that deliver measurable business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain deep knowledge of market trends, competitive positioning, and industry best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and optimize a defined strategic territory to maximize long-term growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a highly motivated enterprise sales professional with a hunter mentality and a passion for solving complex customer challenges. You are equally comfortable opening new doors, engaging executive stakeholders, and navigating sophisticated sales cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative and strategic approach to enterprise selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, presentation, and relationship-building skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to influence and engage senior executives across multiple functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen and a customer-first mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity, authenticity, integrity, and a commitment to continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A disciplined approach to pipeline management, forecasting, and CRM excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resourcefulness in identifying key stakeholders, champions, and decision-makers to drive successful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to balance prospecting activities with advancing and closing opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and proven success working across cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience selling enterprise B2B SaaS solutions or related technology platforms, ideally 12+ years.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of exceeding sales targets through both net-new customer acquisition and strategic account growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with value-based and consultative selling methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence with demonstrated success selling to C-level stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading enterprise sales presentations, workshops, and product demonstrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Salesforce.com or similar CRM platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex, multi-threaded sales opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Privacy, Security, Third-Party Risk Management, Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance (GRC), or related markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling directly into Information Security, Risk, Compliance, or Privacy organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CIPP/E and/or CIPM certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training in Command of the Message or similar enterprise sales methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join OneTrust and help organizations around the world become more trusted while accelerating your career in one of the fastest-growing software companies in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;Where we Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are embracing an office-first culture, encouraging three days a week in office for most roles, with meaningful opportunities to collaborate and celebrate in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each role may have specific requirements or flexibility depending on the scope of the position, so we encourage you to verify this with your recruiter during your first interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;As an employee at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;OneTrust&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;, you will be part of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;OneTeam&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;. That means &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;you’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt; receive support physically, mentally, and emotionally so that you can do your best work both in and out of the office. This includes comprehensive healthcare coverage, flexible PTO, equity RSUs, annual performance bonus opportunities, retirement account support, 14+ weeks of paid parental leave, career development opportunities, company-paid privacy certification exam fees, and much more. Specific benefits differ by country. For more information, talk to your recruiter or visit onetrust.com/careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Resources&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out the following to learn more about OneTrust and its people:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
